    {
      "text": "Heat the olive oil in a saucepan over medium-high heat. Stir in the onion, garlic, and ginger, and cook until tender.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vvReosjIV3nT1uovmSaFwMhIl-k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/Caribbean-BBQ-Sauce-II-DDMFS-Step-02-15996-cce39e0bf5b947e68a4568933c4ef027.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/77079/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce heat to low. Mix in ketchup, brown sugar, molasses, rum, hoisin sauce, tomato paste, vinegar, chili powder, and cayenne pepper. Cook and stir 5 minutes, until well blended and heated through. Stir in remaining rum.",
